135:  - **`features/` is its own tier.** A `features/{slug}/` directory is a durable capability dir — not a project-scoped nor feature-tagged content type like the rest of this list. Its `README.md` is the feature's identity document: it carries base frontmatter with `scope: feature` + `feature: {own-slug}` (self-referential — the README names itself). New feature dirs are created only by user-ratified value-feature addition, never by a sprint.
